  "title": "Family-owed drinks bottling business launches production of hand sanitiser - About HSBC | HSBC UK",
  "description": "A Herefordshire-based bottling and packaging firm is quickly responding to the Covid-19 outbreak by manufacturing and distributing its own branded hand sanitiser to key workers and members of the public.",
