  "body": [
    "1 May 2020",
    "Marches Bottling and Packaging is run alongside the family’s cider production business, Celtic Marches Beverages, which continues to offer its products and services to members of the public online. As a licensed manufacturer of alcohol, the company is authorised by the government to produce hand sanitiser, and was able to quickly turnaround new orders from local surgeries and care homes to help protect them at work, as well as providing to the general public through local grocery stores.",
    "The company has also received a substantial order from Herefordshire Council for the first run of its new product."
